<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Afcol in talks, shareholders cautioned.</title>
<headline>Afcol in talks, shareholders cautioned.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Furniture Companies Ltd said it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
